# Drop-folder for new asset GLBs → tools/optimize_assets.sh → tools/asset_inspect.gd.
# Nothing here is meant to be committed: raw GLBs, the _optimized/ output, and Godot's
# import artifacts (.import + extracted textures) are all scratch. Approved assets get
# MOVED into models/kits/… or models/meshy/… before they go in the game.
*
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore
!README.md
